---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<Base title="About — SLEEP NOD" description="About Dylan Ward / SLEEP NOD.">
  <article class="container about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Dylan Ward (b. 1986, Atlanta) is an artist, producer, and writer working
      across choreography, sound design, film, and live events. Working as
      <strong>SLEEP NOD</strong> in Seattle (2010–2018), Dylan built a body of
      dance, sound, and performance work at Base Arts Space, Velocity Dance
      Center, On the Boards, Men in Dance, Bridge Project, and Gay City Arts.
    </p>
    <p>
      That practice continued into a New York chapter (GreenSpace, Anima
      Productions, Future Colossal) and broader producing work through 2023,
      and now resumes from San Francisco.
    </p>
    <p>
      Writing lives on <a href={site.social.substack} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Substack</a>.
      Video archive is on <a href={site.social.vimeo} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vimeo</a>.
      For commissions or correspondence, <a href={`mailto:${site.social.email}`}>email</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
